For i=2: next "one green bottle". Good.
For i=10: current "Ten green bottles". Good.

Potential issue: if start - take < 1, e.g. start=1 take=2, range(1, -1, -1) gives 1,0. Then i=0 current bottle_phrase(0) -> "No green bottles"? But not expected. Could limit to max(1, start-take+1)? But tests only valid. If take > start, maybe should only recite down to 1? The canonical maybe take can be up
